            "notes": "This is when the build comes online.\n\n[Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) sets people on fire, [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) gives a massive damage boost.\n\n[Silver Spurs](item_8d812772-e37d-4af2-ade8-6a43d6e64a4c) gives you a 5 bullet reload for every use of coach gun. Greatly increasing your weapon uptime.\n\nAside from those 2 items you're really just building to get your WP stat up. \n\nThe way I apply Calamity is I usually hit people with a single unscoped shot into a scoped shot, and then I either scope again or do the triple hipfire scope combo depending on the distance. \n\nUse your coach guns to take aggressive angles and hit your shots.",
